  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3746,
      "text": "Another sign for them is that We carried their offspring[11] in the loaded Ark,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3747,
      "text": "and We created for them similar things on which they ride.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3748,
      "text": "If We willed, We could drown them, then there would be no one to respond to their cry, nor could they be rescued,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3749,
      "text": "except by a mercy from Us, leaving them to enjoy for a while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3750,
      "text": "When it is said to them, “Beware of what is ahead of you and what is behind you[12], so that you may be shown mercy[13].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3751,
      "text": "No sign ever comes to them from their Lord except that they turn away from it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3752,
      "text": "And when it is said to them, “Spend of what Allah has provided you with”, the disbelievers say to the believers, “Should we feed those whom Allah could feed if He willed? You are clearly misguided!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3753,
      "text": "They say, “When will this promise come to pass, if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3754,
      "text": "They are not awaiting but a single Blast that will seize them while they are still disputing[14].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3755,
      "text": "Then they will not be able to make a will, nor will they be able to return to their households.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3756,
      "text": "The Trumpet will be blown[15] [again], and at once they will rush from their graves to their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3757,
      "text": "They will say, “Woe to us! Who has resurrected us from our resting place?” [They will be told,] “This is what the Most Compassionate promised, and the messengers told the truth.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3758,
      "text": "It will only be a single Blast, and at once they will all be brought before Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3759,
      "text": "On that Day no soul will be wronged in the least, nor will you be recompensed except for what you used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 443,
      "ruku": 384,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
